    "text_full": "Solutions\nTools\nIntegrations\nResources\nPricing\nGet a demo\nLogin\nRegister\nFOR AMAZON RESELLERS\nTurn Supplier Catalogs into Profitable Purchase Orders. Fast\n\nWholesale moves fast. Your sourcing stack should too — from first look at a product to sent PO and active listings, without switching tools.\n\nStart free 14-day trial\nGet a demo\n\nTrusted by Amazon sellers doing $10K–$500K+/mo\n\n4.9\nCapterra & Chrome Store\n45k+\nExtension Users\n1M+\nASINs analyzed monthly\nAmazon\nSoftware Partner\nDiscover\nAnalyze\nSource\nList\nTurn a supplier price list into a shortlist you can order from\n\nUpload, ASIN-match, filter by margin and competition. Restricted products out, viable leads in — without a single manual lookup.\n\nExplore →\nFOR AMAZON RESELLERS\nDifferent sellers, same connected workflow\nWholesale\nOnline arbitrage\nDropshipping\nAgency\nWrong brand, wrong supplier, wrong COG — any one kills the deal\n\nRight product, wrong supplier. Right supplier, wrong COG. Every tool catches a different one — and passes the data to the next step so nothing gets re-entered.\n\nBrand research before the first call\nPrice list filtered to viable leads\nLowest COG confirmed across suppliers\nPO built and sent in one click\nHow wholesale works →\nDiscover\nAnalyze\nSource\nList\nKnow the brand, the market, and the supplier before the price list arrives\n\nWrong brand, gated product, competitor already there. Answer those questions before you make contact.\n\nMargins on any page, instantly\n\nBuy Box share, IP risk, and price drops on any Amazon or supplier page. You never open a new tab.\n\nBrowser Extension →\nFind brands to sell\n\nSee revenue, Buy Box ownership, and Amazon's share across the full brand catalog, not just the ASIN you spotted.\n\nWhat your competitors are stocking\n\nTrack any storefront over time. See what they add, drop, and how their catalog shifts — before it hits your margins.\n\nYour next batch is buried in a supplier spreadsheet. Uncover it in minutes\n\nUpload, match ASINs, filter by margin, clear restrictions. What's left is what you can actually order.\n\nGet from price list to shortlist, fast\n\nUpload, ASIN-match, filter by margin and competition, move to order. No manual lookups, no formula maintenance.\n\nPrice List Analyzer →\nFocus on opportunities you can actually act on\n\nCheck up to 20,000 ASINs at once. Restricted products are out before anything moves to a purchase order.\n\nFind vetted suppliers for any brand\n\nLocate reseller-friendly suppliers and verified distributors with contact details. Save them straight to your workspace.\n\nThe order comes after the research —\nit shouldn't feel like starting over\n\nMake sure you commit to the most profitable supplier. Data from your analysis carries into the PO — nothing re-entered, nothing looked up again.\n\nBuy at best COG every time\n\nSee every supplier offering the same ASIN, with COGs and full history. Compare before you commit.\n\nProducts →\nEvery supplier, one place\n\nManage every supplier in one place with contacts, business terms, products, price lists, and order history.\n\nShortlist to PO to listing, instantly\n\nEasily turn your shortlist into a purchase order, then list your items right after. SKUs, costs, and shipping details transfer automatically.\n\nMost of what costs you happens after you ship\n\nList directly from your purchase order. Catch unit discrepancies while they're still claimable. Track your true cost, down to the inbound fee.\n\nBulk listing direct from purchase order\n\nSelect products, set condition and fulfillment, submit to Amazon. Errors surface with the exact failure reason — no guessing.\n\nLister →\nCatch missing shipment units early\n\nCatch missing units on closed shipments immediately. File a manual claim with Amazon before the 60-day window closes.\n\nYour actual landed cost, not an estimate\n\nUnit cost, prep fees, and inbound charges pulled from your orders and shipments automatically. Weighted across every PO the SKU appeared in.\n\nSeller Assistant connects your entire workflow in one place\n\nFrom first look at a product to sent PO and listing products on Amazon, without switching tools.\n\nStart free trial\nGet a demo\nWHAT AMAZON SELLERS ARE SAYING\nSee why Amazon resellers rely on Seller Assistant daily\n\nTrusted by sellers doing $100K+/month\n\n\"Seller Assistant can help you identify gaps in the market, great potential products that you can wholesale, resale, sell in whatever way that you want\".\n\nKrystel Abi-Assi\n\nFounder of Amazon Sellers Society\n\n\"Seller Assistant is a powerful product-sourcing software designed to meet the diverse needs of Amazon wholesale sellers, along with those involved in online arbitrage\".\n\nIan Kaneshiro\n\nHost of \"Not Another eComm Podcast\"\n\n\"It is a cool software for Amazon sellers. Once you learn how it works, you'll find it easier than ever to search for wholesale products. It'll do the magic for you\".\n\nVova Even\n\nAmazon Seller\n\n\"The best tool for conducting arbitrage on Amazon. With it, you will be able to find profitable products in a very easy and very fast way. Additionally, you will save a lot of time with the included Restriction Checker\".\n\nRod Hilfer\n\nAmazon Expert for 13 years\n\n\"Seller Assistant provides advanced analytics to help make informed decisions. Furthermore, it has an IP Alert Chrome extension. As you browse products to potentially sell on Amazon, it will give you real-time intellectual property risk alerts\".\n\nRyan Hogue\n\n7-figure FBA & Print on Demand Seller\n\n\"A software that does everything! It offers a seamless product research experience and allows you to sort through and be spoon-fed profitable buys that you can make, along with all the most important information\".\n\nBryan Guerra\n\nDropshipping & Entrepreneurship Expert\n\nAll reviews\nEverything that makes it feel like one workflow\n\nThe features that keep data moving across every stage — so nothing gets lost between tools.\n\nLanded cost\n\nUnit price, prep, and inbound fees pulled automatically from your orders and shipments.\n\nNotes\n\nComment thread on every ASIN — shared across the Extension, Price List Analyzer, and Products.\n\nData sync\n\nSupplier info, COGs, and warehouse details entered once and carried into every tool automatically.\n\nTeam accounts\n\nSub-accounts let VAs run the full sourcing workflow without access to your Seller Central account.\n\nIntegrations\n\nGoogle Sheets, Zapier, Make, Airtable, and the SA API — connect or export without code.\n\nTags\n\nAttach to any ASIN in Products or Price List Analyzer. Filter and share context team-wide.\n\nKeepa charts\n\nPrice history and BSR trends in the Extension and Price List Analyzer. No separate tab.\n\nProfit calculator\n\nFBM and FBA margin on every product page, fees included.\n\nReady to stop switching tools?\nYour whole workflow in one platform\n\nStop juggling Keepa, spreadsheets, and supplier sites. Research, analyze, source, track shipments, and list on Amazon — all from one connected workspace.\n\nStart free for 14 days\n\nCancel anytime\n\nNot sure which plan fits your sourcing workflow? Chat with our team — we're happy to help.\n\nNAVIGATION\nHome\nPricing\nDownload\nSOLUTIONS\nOnline Arbitrage\nWholesale\nDropshipping\nAgencies\nPRODUCTS\nPrice List Analyzer\nLister\nPurchase Orders\nSuppliers\nWarehouses\nSeller Assistant Extension\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nVPN by Seller Assistant\nBulk Restriction Checker\nSeller Spy\nBrand Analyzer\nFREE TOOLS\nASIN Lookup\nIP-Alert Lookup\nSupplier Finder\nASIN to UPC\nUPC to ASIN\nEAN to ASIN\nFEATURES\nFBM & FBA Calculator\nVAT Calculator\nAmazon IP-Alert\nSide Panel View\nAmazon Quick View\nStorefront Widget\nAlerts & Flags\nRestrictions Checker\nSales Estimator\nOffers\nVariation Viewer\nStock Checker\nASIN Grabber\nSub-Accounts for VAs\nExport to Google Sheets\nNotes\nALTERNATIVES\nAnalyzer.Tools Alternative\nScan Unlimited Alternative\nSmartScout Alternative\nRevSeller Alternative\nBuyBotPro Alternative\nAZInsight Alternative\nSellerAmp Alternative\nIP-Alert Alternative\nDS Quick View Alternative\nPARTNERS\nAffiliate Program\nPartners\nAmazon Experts\nPress Kit\nRESOURCES\nBlog\nGet a Demo\nHelp Center\nOffice Hours\nNews & Updates\nProduct Roadmap\nReviews\nINTEGRATIONS\nZapier\nMake\nAirtable\nn8n\nGoogle Sheets\nSeller Central\nPrep Centers\nAPI\nOTHER LINKS\nIP-Alert by Seller Assistant\nLANGUAGE\n🇬🇧 English\n🇷🇺 Русский\n🇪🇸 Español\n🇹🇷 Türkçe\n\nCopyright © 2019-2026 Linen Art, LLC. All rights reserved.\nAmazon and all related marks are trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.\n\nTerms of Use\n|\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nCookie Policy\n|\nRefund Policy"
